      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغفّل</span></b>  as intrans.: see 6, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغفّلهُ</span> <i>He watched for his unmindfulness, forgetfulness, negligence, heedlessness,</i> or <i>inadvertence;</i>
(S, Mgh, O, Msb;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغافل</span></b> , (S, O,)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استغفلهُ</span></b> : (TA:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغافل</span> [as trans.] in this
sense [without a prep.] is a mistake. (Mgh.)

